{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 0751U  NewRiver REIT PLC  09 September 2026   NewRiver REIT plc(\"NewRiver\" or the \"Company\")Notification of transactions by persons discharging managerial responsibilitiesThe Company announces that on 7 September 2026, Allan Lockhart, Chief Executive Officer of the Company, exercised 4…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 0751U  NewRiver REIT PLC  09 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["NewRiver REIT plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["(\"NewRiver\" or the \"Company\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notification of transactions by persons discharging managerial responsibilities"]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company announces that on 7 September 2026, Allan Lockhart, Chief Executive Officer of the Company, exercised 454,123 nil cost options which were granted in September 2021 under the Company's Performance Share Plan 2016 ('PSP') and subsequently vested on 7 September 2024. 214,511 Ordinary shares were sold in order to cover the associated tax liability. Following this exercise, Allan Lockhart has a beneficial interest in 1,261,629 Ordinary Shares, increased by 239,612 Ordinary Shares from 1,022,017 Ordinary Shares prior to the exercise."]},{"type":"p","children":["In addition, Will Hobman, Chief Financial Officer of the Company, exercised 198,072 nil cost options which were granted in September 2021 under the Company's Performance Share Plan 2016 ('PSP') and subsequently vested on 7 September 2024. 93,562 Ordinary shares were sold in order to cover the associated tax liability. Following this exercise, Will Hobman has a beneficial interest in 674,381 Ordinary Shares, increased by 104,510 Ordinary Shares from 569,871 Ordinary Shares prior to the exercise."]},{"type":"p","children":["Vesting of the awards were subject to the Company's total shareholder return and total accounting return performance conditions measured over a three-year period, which resulted in vesting of 50% of maximum. Executive Directors were then subject to a two-year holding period from vesting, which ended on 7 September 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["The exercise of the nil-cost options has been satisfied through the transfer of existing Shares held by the Employee Benefit Trust and, as such, no new Shares have been issued in connection with the option exercise."]},{"type":"p","children":["This announcement is made in accordance with the requirements of the UK Market Abuse Regulation. The notification of dealing forms can be found below."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities / person closely associated"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["a)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Allan Lockhart"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["2"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Reason for the notification"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["a)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Position/status"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["PDMR - Chief Executive Officer"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["b)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Initial notification /Amendment"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","